{"5157000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road to Verdant", "steam_appid": 5157000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Road to Verdant combines the adrenaline and speed of an action <i>runner</i> game with the depth and customization of a fantasy RPG. Get ready to sprint, dodge deadly traps, and face countless dangers as you power up your character to survive increasingly intense challenges. The only way to progress through the missions is to acquire better gear, purchase upgrades in the shop, and collect numerous items that will help you overcome every trial.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast-Paced Action &amp; Reflexes:</strong> Put your skills to the test by dodging obstacles and navigating dynamic environments at breakneck speed.<br><table><tr><td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5157000/extras/5b9dee979e2d1b7bcd21f1a220c7d415.poster.avif?t=1788280303\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5157000/extras/5b9dee979e2d1b7bcd21f1a220c7d415.webm?t=1788280303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5157000/extras/5b9dee979e2d1b7bcd21f1a220c7d415.mp4?t=1788280303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></td></tr></table><br></li><li><strong>Dangers &amp; Mythical Beasts:</strong> Fight your way through hordes of relentless enemies and get ready to hunt down the fearsome dragons guarding the end of your path.<br><table><tr><td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5157000/extras/b333de2c4655429bad201de773728dd8.poster.avif?t=1788280303\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"h